y good way to  compare it  so these are just some functionalities  which are provided in bokeh itself no  other  data visualization library will let you  work so well  with graphs and will let you customize  your graphs to this extent  thank you all for watching this video on  the python data visualization tutorial i  hope you liked it if you have any  questions please feel free to put them  in the comment section thank you again  hi there if you like this video  subscribe to the simply learn youtube  channel and click here to watch similar  videos to nerd up and get certified  click here
 

